$c15,1  $c9  RULES$c15
$c15,1  $c14  1.$c15 This is a private network. Authorized users only.
$c15,1  $c14  2.$c15 All traffic is encrypted. DMs are end-to-end.
$c15,1  $c14  3.$c15 No logging of private messages. Ever.
$c15,1  $c14  4.$c15 Register your nick: /msg NickServ REGISTER <pass> <email>
